    <!-- About & Legal -->
    <string name="about_description">An independent chess application providing offline chess, bots, online chess architecture, local music playback and public chess-profile integrations.</string>
    <string name="about_disclaimer">ChessHub is not affiliated with or endorsed by Chess.com or Lichess.</string>
    <string name="privacy_body">ChessHub stores games, settings, and puzzle progress locally on your device using SQLite/Room. Passwords are never stored in plaintext. Public profile requests are sent directly over HTTPS to official Lichess and Chess.com public endpoints only when you request them. Local music playback accesses only files you select or scan on your device.</string>
    <string name="licenses_body">Built with Kotlin, Jetpack Compose, AndroidX Core/Lifecycle/Room, Retrofit, OkHttp, Moshi, and Kotlin Coroutines (Apache 2.0 License). Material Icons provided under Apache 2.0. Plus Jakarta Sans and JetBrains Mono fonts licensed under SIL Open Font License 1.1.</string>

